The AX89X has three radio paths:
Radio	Chip	Connection	Driver path	Status
2.4 GHz	QCN5024	AHB (internal to IPQ8078)	ath11k_ahb	Module present
5 GHz band 1	QCN5054	AHB or PCIe	ath11k_ahb or ath11k_pci	Need to verify
