    /lib/firmware/ath11k/IPQ8074/hw2.0/firmware-2.bin — radio firmware

These are not kernel modules and cannot be cross-compiled. They come from one of three places: the ipq-wifi OpenWrt package (has board files for known devices), extracted from the AX89X stock firmware's ART partition, or the upstream linux-firmware package. The dmesg output will tell us immediately whether the firmware load is failing or if ath11k is not even probing at all.

