The Q6 DSP is booting, reading the chip ID, and panicking because the firmware was compiled expecting IPQ8074 hw2.0 silicon but the actual hardware identifies itself as hw1.0. The q6_fw files are the wrong revision for this specific IPQ8078 die. This is why it crashes on every attempt — not a missing file, a wrong file.

